{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/06570757df91de211e5c9d908ac5f409.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1012 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be an old man sitting on a park bench? What does he do all day, sitting there with his newspaper, lost in thought, as time drifts by?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a walking stick in hand, an endless supply of bread (and plenty of comfortable benches), you\u2019ll explore a colorful world full of puzzles, hidden objects, and of course\u2026 <strong>pigeons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you\u2019ll lead an ever-growing flock of adorable, customizable pigeons that will follow your every command: make them steal useful items, help you solve puzzles, or simply keep you company while you fish, doodle, or nap. In <i>The Bench</i>, pigeons are your best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play harmless pranks on park visitors and maintenance staff, disrupt picnics and parties, toss passersby into the air, and interact with the world around you however you like! The world outside the retirement home is full of life and color, and as you carry on your escape, memories of a life once lived as an agent resurface, reminders that you\u2019re far from being just a simple retiree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed, colorful maps, each with its own quirks, and dive into fun mini-games: solve puzzles, doodle in your notebook, play chess, bowls, football, or go fishing. There\u2019s always something to keep your mind sharp, and stop you from dozing off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of puzzles, hidden objects, and adventure games, <i>The Bench</i> is a delightful blend of relaxation and challenge, with a touch of wholesome humor. The game also features a list of unique Twitch integrations to discover.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/5dc9be23eb3ae765acf9e22a44fce33941d346be.jpg"},{"name":"FillPoint Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/717d6be8bd9f1933cd582c6dad804f6c33fc1013.jpg"},{"name":"Stamp Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/6e92d2165491ef1211101c30080463fad869de1d.jpg"},{"name":"You are Gold!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/ed93a6dd67ffa4c4eda202615a70d04b4499da5f.jpg"},{"name":"Free Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/d1411dcfa8ba37576342e29feafbee149e35fda1.jpg"},{"name":"That was a walk in the park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/078707007561949466e1b3da67b6dda87dcdc6d2.jpg"},{"name":"The Greenhouse Effect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/c48441f3aa76ae21bd324070bcdc4e7d798a8412.jpg"},{"name":"Sewer Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/da719298c0593efbcfdf5eaf6498ed96da59cf3a.jpg"},{"name":"Carpenters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/2b5a80441507e04b080c41418fca6ecf0f593912.jpg"},{"name":"Ivory Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183410/6deca077f838d1a2b5c95362e5250daac121f3ed.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183410?t=1761499161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/1318cbb8ee08576e51e01568377c113fd745a48f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761499161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/70a1f40a33e5e13b101f8ee885b54ab7d2eca409/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761499161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/70a1f40a33e5e13b101f8ee885b54ab7d2eca409/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761499161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/06570757df91de211e5c9d908ac5f409.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1012 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be an old man sitting on a park bench? What does he do all day, sitting there with his newspaper, lost in thought, as time drifts by?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a walking stick in hand, an endless supply of bread (and plenty of comfortable benches), you\u2019ll explore a colorful world full of puzzles, hidden objects, and of course\u2026 <strong>pigeons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/b26703ecf9f1d5a74796e9461c0f7c26.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you\u2019ll lead an ever-growing flock of adorable, customizable pigeons that will follow your every command: make them steal useful items, help you solve puzzles, or simply keep you company while you fish, doodle, or nap. In <i>The Bench</i>, pigeons are your best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/f33e99e100058d922e0581deb20d9f52.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play harmless pranks on park visitors and maintenance staff, disrupt picnics and parties, toss passersby into the air, and interact with the world around you however you like! The world outside the retirement home is full of life and color, and as you carry on your escape, memories of a life once lived as an agent resurface, reminders that you\u2019re far from being just a simple retiree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/2108a53d6a007f431c8398ceb7ee79e4.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed, colorful maps, each with its own quirks, and dive into fun mini-games: solve puzzles, doodle in your notebook, play chess, bowls, football, or go fishing. There\u2019s always something to keep your mind sharp, and stop you from dozing off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.poster.avif?t=1761499161\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.webm?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/extras/0c2e8759bfad27c11fea763b69b244ee.mp4?t=1761499161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of puzzles, hidden objects, and adventure games, <i>The Bench</i> is a delightful blend of relaxation and challenge, with a touch of wholesome humor. The game also features a list of unique Twitch integrations to discover.</p>","developers":["Voxel Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183410/header.jpg?t=1761499161","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183410/1506363758/c5d914e618555ad35fcda6d861282b40159088a6/1761319908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761320454","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183410/1506363758/c5d914e618555ad35fcda6d861282b40159088a6/1761319908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761320454","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183410/1506363758/c5d914e618555ad35fcda6d861282b40159088a6/1761319908/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761320454","id":257222175,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222175/movie480.mp4?t=1761320454","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222175/movie_max.mp4?t=1761320454"},"name":"The Bench: Game Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222175/71c046a8572ceda5518ba062b2651fa6477dd0f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761320454","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222175/movie480.webm?t=1761320454","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222175/movie_max.webm?t=1761320454"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183410/233471533/114a8a248935cd93df2c617f1b442df438d25168/1760984663/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760985775","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamst